    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubble Battle Blast 3D is a retro arcade third-person shooter where you control a spaceship, battling your way through 8 arenas in which a guard drone protects bubbles. You will earn ship-enhancing items and temporary power-ups by blasting bubbles with lasers, and earn bonus points after each arena to upgrade faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different arena levels to battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bonus level after each arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 different power-ups or ship upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by Sway Casey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A final boss battle</p></li></ul>",
